\ Companion module for help_imported_word.1z.
\
\ A facade that republishes the helper module next to a documented word of its own, so the driver
\ reaches one word through a plain `use` and another through `reexport`.

"import_field_fidelity_helper.1z" load reexport

\\ A word the facade defines itself, reached by its importer through a plain `use`.
facade-word: [ 7 ] ;
